WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.672
Light lets you see. It comes from
a light source, like the Sun.

2
00:00:08.892 --> 00:00:13.351
Take all the light away, and it
is dark. Dark is no light at all.

3
00:00:13.851 --> 00:00:17.241
The Sun, a lamp, a
candle, a torch, a fire.

4
00:00:17.461 --> 00:00:20.897
Each one makes its own light.
Each one is a light source.

5
00:00:21.117 --> 00:00:23.997
Switch it off, or blow it
out, and the light stops.

6
00:00:24.217 --> 00:00:28.582
The Sun is the biggest light source
we have. Daylight is sunlight.

7
00:00:29.082 --> 00:00:32.054
The Moon is bright at
night. Is it a light source?

8
00:00:32.274 --> 00:00:36.639
No. It makes no light of its own.
It shines back the Sun's light.

9
00:00:36.859 --> 00:00:40.017
A mirror and white paper
shine light back too.

10
00:00:40.237 --> 00:00:44.742
Put them in a dark cupboard, and they
go dark. So they are not sources.

11
00:00:44.962 --> 00:00:49.606
Now sort them into two groups:
makes light, or only shines it back.

12
00:00:50.106 --> 00:00:53.636
Here is a room. Daylight
comes in, and the lamp is on.

13
00:00:53.856 --> 00:00:58.778
Predict: with the curtains shut and
the lamp off, what will you see?

14
00:00:58.998 --> 00:01:02.295
Close the curtains. The
lamp still lights the room.

15
00:01:02.515 --> 00:01:05.627
Now switch off the lamp.
It is completely dark.

16
00:01:05.847 --> 00:01:09.562
You cannot see anything, because
there is no light to see by.

17
00:01:09.782 --> 00:01:14.983
Did that match your prediction? Switch
the lamp on, and you can see again.

18
00:01:15.203 --> 00:01:18.268
Darkness is what is left
when there is no light.

19
00:01:18.768 --> 00:01:23.645
We cannot see light travelling.
So scientists draw a model of it.

20
00:01:23.865 --> 00:01:27.394
They draw light as straight lines,
from the source to your eye.

21
00:01:27.614 --> 00:01:31.515
That drawing is a model: a
clear way of showing an idea.

22
00:01:31.735 --> 00:01:36.286
A globe is a model of the Earth.
It shows the shape and the seas.

23
00:01:36.506 --> 00:01:40.314
It leaves out every house and
tree. A model leaves the rest out.

24
00:01:40.814 --> 00:01:45.365
Long ago, some people thought
eyes sent out beams, like torches.

25
00:01:45.585 --> 00:01:49.347
If that were true, you could
see in a dark room. You cannot.

26
00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:54.164
Testing showed that light comes
from a source, into your eye.

27
00:01:54.384 --> 00:01:57.078
What people know changes
when they test it.

28
00:01:57.578 --> 00:02:02.036
A light source makes its own
light. The Sun is the biggest one.

29
00:02:02.256 --> 00:02:05.878
The Moon, a mirror and white
paper only shine light back.

30
00:02:06.098 --> 00:02:10.882
Darkness is not a thing. It is what
is left when there is no light.

31
00:02:11.102 --> 00:02:15.839
A model shows an idea clearly.
Ideas change when people test them.
